; A grave, opened on the ground ahead of the approaching swarm, which opens, waits, and collapses
; on whatever treads on its bank. The art is tools/art/gravewell.py: the bank is drawn at the
; trigger radius, and the blast - wider than the trigger on purpose - is drawn by the collapse
; itself, out of the radius the code tests (GravewellTrap.BlastRadius). Mass Grave's great grave is
; its own drawing at twice the size (gravewell-pit-mass.png), shown at x2 like the grave.
